    "comparison実バイトSHA256→各location evidence.snapshotSHA256。",
    "最終location canonical JSON(hashlib.sha256(json.dumps(row,sort_keys=True,ensure_ascii=False).encode()))→binding.adoptionSHA256/selection研究候補hash。",
